==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

